{"product_id":"the-rising-of-the-shield-hero-volume-04-the-rising-of-the-shield-hero-series-light-novel","title":"The Rising of the Shield Hero Volume 04 (The Rising of the Shield Hero Series: Light Novel)","description":"\u003cp\u003eNaofumi Iwatani, an uncharismatic Otaku who spends his days on games and manga, suddenly finds himself summoned to a parallel universe! He discovers he is one of four heroes equipped with legendary weapons and tasked with saving the world from its prophesied destruction. As the Shield Hero, the weakest of the heroes, all is not as it seems. Naofumi is soon alone, penniless, and betrayed. With no one to turn to, and nowhere to run, he is left with only his shield. Now, Naofumi must rise to become the legendary Shield Hero and save the world!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 178\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Aneko Yusagi\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781935548652\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 344\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45390172913817,"sku":"Manga-A-19781935548652","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/682475338da35-The-Rising-of-the-Shield-Hero-Volume-04-The-Rising-of-the-Shield-Hero-Series-Light_4463_1.jpg?v=1748277343","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-rising-of-the-shield-hero-volume-04-the-rising-of-the-shield-hero-series-light-novel","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}